do
---An item group. Item groups are the tabs shown above the list of craftable items in the player's inventory GUI. The built-in groups are "logistics", "production", "intermediate-products" and "combat" but mods can define their own.
---
---Items are sorted into item groups by sorting them into a [subgroup](https://lua-api.factorio.com/latest/prototypes/ItemPrototype.html%23subgroup#subgroup) which then belongs to an [item group](https://lua-api.factorio.com/latest/prototypes/ItemSubGroup.html%23group#group).
---
---[View Documentation](https://lua-api.factorio.com/latest/prototypes/ItemGroup.html)
---@class (exact) ItemGroup:Prototype
---@
---
---Path to the icon that is shown to represent this item group.
---
---Only loaded, and mandatory if `icons` is not defined.
---
---[View Documentation](https://lua-api.factorio.com/latest/prototypes/ItemGroup.html%23icon#icon)
---@field icon? FileName
---@
---
---The size of the square icon, in pixels. E.g. `32` for a 32px by 32px icon. Must be larger than `0`.
---
---The base game uses 128px icons for item groups.
---
---Only loaded if `icons` is not defined.
---
---[View Documentation](https://lua-api.factorio.com/latest/prototypes/ItemGroup.html%23icon_size#icon_size)
---@field icon_size? SpriteSizeType
---@
---
---The icon that is shown to represent this item group. Can't be an empty array.
---
---[View Documentation](https://lua-api.factorio.com/latest/prototypes/ItemGroup.html%23icons#icons)
---@field icons? (IconData)[]
---@
---
---Item ingredients in recipes are ordered by item group. The `order_in_recipe` property can be used to specify the ordering in recipes without affecting the inventory order.
---
---[View Documentation](https://lua-api.factorio.com/latest/prototypes/ItemGroup.html%23order_in_recipe#order_in_recipe)
---@field order_in_recipe? Order
